# Title: Unusual File Download from Direct IP Address
# ID: 025bd229-fd1f-4fdb-97ab-20006e1a5368
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-07
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1564.004
# Description: Detects the download of suspicious file type from URLs with IP
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(Contents=regex("http[s]?://[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3}") AND (TargetFilename CONTAIN ".ps1:Zone" OR TargetFilename CONTAIN ".bat:Zone" OR TargetFilename CONTAIN ".exe:Zone" OR TargetFilename CONTAIN ".vbe:Zone" OR TargetFilename CONTAIN ".vbs:Zone" OR TargetFilename CONTAIN ".dll:Zone" OR TargetFilename CONTAIN ".one:Zone" OR TargetFilename CONTAIN ".cmd:Zone" OR TargetFilename CONTAIN ".hta:Zone" OR TargetFilename CONTAIN ".xll:Zone" OR TargetFilename CONTAIN ".lnk:Zone"))
